#: ../../tools/pombase_tools.rst:32 e0eed3fbb3d14884b0ef06c871b32bd6
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed gene information from PomBase for fission "
"yeast (S. pombe) by systematic ID. Returns gene name, protein product, "
"InterPro domain annotations, deletion viability, UniProt cross-reference,"
" and transmembrane domain coordinates. S. pombe is a key model organism "
"for cell cycle, chromosome biology, and RNA processing research. Example:"
" SPBC11B10.09 returns cdc2 (cyclin-dependent kinase), essential for cell "
"division."
msgstr ""

