msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/pombase_tools.rst:36 fd5b04f282184af3b9fd19cca830b91b
msgid ""
"``gene_id`` (string) (required) PomBase systematic gene identifier. "
"Examples: 'SPBC11B10.09' (cdc2), 'SPAC2F7.03c' (pom1), 'SPAC1002.17c' "
"(ase1)."
