#: ../../tools/pombase_tools.rst:63 2a23c61ea1844028b814ddcf2e81176f
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get phenotype annotations for a fission yeast (S. pombe)"
" gene from PomBase. Returns deletion viability, FYPO (Fission Yeast "
"Phenotype Ontology) term annotations with evidence codes. S. pombe "
"phenotypes are a key resource for understanding gene function in cell "
"biology. Example: SPBC11B10.09 (cdc2) is inviable when deleted, "
"reflecting its essential role in cell division."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/pombase_tools.rst:67 d6a23b073a0143a29b86672958b4da52
msgid ""
"``gene_id`` (string) (required) PomBase systematic gene identifier. "
"Examples: 'SPBC11B10.09' (cdc2), 'SPAC2F7.03c' (pom1)."
msgstr ""

